Comparison
==================================================================================================
claimed M_min (source)                               1.0e+16 kg
  completion A: M_min = 2.699e+14 kg   -> +1.57 decades from the claimed 1e16 kg
  completion B: M_min = 2.204e+14 kg   -> +1.66 decades from the claimed 1e16 kg
  completion C: no positive floor at all

pre-declared match interval                          1e15 <= M_min <= 1e17 kg
  completion A inside the interval?                  False
  completion B inside the interval?                  False

